      "type": "text",
      "text": "resp arrest is the cessation of effective breathing in a pt who still has a pulse. It is a pre-arrest emergency that, if untxed, will rapidly progress to cardiac arrest from hypoxic cardiac standstill (typically w/in 4-6 min). Prompt airway management & ventilatory support are the priorities."
     }
